    "changes": "SRD 5.2.1 pp. 97\u201398 adventuring gear (Healer\u2019s Kit, Holy Symbol, Holy Water, Hunting Trap, Ink, Ink Pen, Jug, Ladder, Lamp, Lantern, Bullseye, Lantern, Hooded, Lock) adapted into versioned mundane gear families with structured actions, checks, damage, measures, trait keys, pack contents, spellcasting focus classes, weights and listed prices from the entries and their tables. Names and numeric values are adapted; trait keys summarize the remaining rules, in places close to the printed wording; no rules prose is copied as text. Catalogue data grants no inventory, proficiency, action or gameplay permissions; every record is unavailable."
